{"seq":36,"slug":"ai-product-management","title":"AI 产品管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AI 产品管理\n\n当 LLM 和生成式 AI 从实验室走向生产环境，产品经理的角色发生了根本性变化。传统产品管理假设输入与输出之间存在确定性映射——同一个按钮永远触发同一个结果。AI 产品打破了这一前提：输出是概率性的，质量存在光谱而非二值判断，模型性能随数据分布漂移而退化。这些特性要求 PM 掌握一套全新的思维框架和实操方法论。\n\n本 hub 专注于 **AI 产品管理** 这一交叉领域的独特挑战与实践。它与兄弟 hub 的分工如下：\n\n- **产品管理**（`30_product-management`）覆盖通用的产品发现、策略、优先级与执行方法论——这些是基础功，本 hub 不重复讲解，而是在 AI 语境下延伸和重构。\n- **AI 时代程序员成长**（`13_ai-era-programmer-growth`）侧重工程师视角的 AI 工具使用与技术成长路径——本 hub 则站在 PM 视角，关注如何将 AI 能力转化为用户价值和商业成果。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n**路径一：有产品经理基础，转型 AI PM**\n→ 基础篇快速过 → 设计篇深读 → 执行篇实操 → 战略篇进阶\n\n**路径二：技术背景，想理解 AI 产品思维**\n→ 基础篇第一章了解角色差异 → 设计篇理解用户体验思维 → 执行篇学习度量方法 → 战略篇掌握治理框架\n\n**路径三：创业者或技术管理者**\n→ 战略篇的竞争壁垒与路线图 → 设计篇的数据飞轮 → 执行篇的运营体系\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本的产品管理概念（用户研究、优先级排序、路线图——可参考 `30_product-management`）\n- 对机器学习有入门级了解（训练/推理区别、精确率/召回率的含义）\n- 对 LLM 有基本体感（用过 ChatGPT/Claude 等工具即可）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇：AI 产品管理的底层逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-pm-role-and-skills","title":"AI 产品经理的角色与核心能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/foundations/ai-pm-role-and-skills"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-product-lifecycle","title":"AI 产品生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/foundations/ai-product-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ml-fundamentals-for-pm","title":"PM 必备的机器学习基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/foundations/ml-fundamentals-for-pm"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"design","title":"设计篇：为不确定性而设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-native-ux-design","title":"AI 原生用户体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/design/ai-native-ux-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"non-deterministic-system-design","title":"非确定性系统的产品设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/design/non-deterministic-system-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-flywheel-design","title":"数据飞轮设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/design/data-flywheel-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"execution","title":"执行篇：从原型到生产的落地实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-product-metrics","title":"AI 产品度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/execution/ai-product-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"model-evaluation-and-iteration","title":"模型评估与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/execution/model-evaluation-and-iteration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-product-operations","title":"AI 产品运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/execution/ai-product-operations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy","title":"战略篇：构建持久的 AI 产品竞争力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"responsible-ai-governance","title":"负责任 AI 治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/strategy/responsible-ai-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-product-competitive-moat","title":"AI 产品竞争壁垒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/strategy/ai-product-competitive-moat"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-product-roadmap","title":"AI 产品路线图规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/ai-product-management/strategy/ai-product-roadmap"}]}]}